{"id": "3326602", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – תחום בין עקומות וחישוב", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_NO_MINMAX_V2\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">חישוב אינטגרל כפול על תחום בין עקומות</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <div>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle D\\)</span> התחום החסום על ידי</div>\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0;\">\n          \\(\\displaystyle y=\\sqrt{x},\\qquad y={{CT:0}}\\sqrt{x},\\qquad y={{CT:1}}\\)\n        </div>\n        <div>חשבו</div>\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0;\">\n          \\(\\displaystyle I=\\iint_D {{CT:2}}\\,dx\\,dy\\)\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          כתבו תחילה את האינטגרל בצורה\n          <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\int_a^b\\int_{c(y)}^{d(y)}\\cdots\\,dx\\,dy\\)</span>.\n        </div>\n      </div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">הגבולות והתוצאה</div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(175px,1fr));gap:10px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;align-items:start;\"><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle a=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle b=\\)</span>[[input:ans2]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle c(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans3]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle d(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans4]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></div>\n        <div style=\"max-width:260px;margin:10px auto 0;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:170px;\"><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle I=\\)</span>[[input:ans5]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:4px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div></div>\n      <span\n        style=\"\n          position:absolute;\n          left:-10000px;\n          top:auto;\n          width:1px;\n          height:1px;\n          overflow:hidden;\n          white-space:nowrap;\n        \"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      >[[input:ans6]][[validation:ans6]][[input:ans7]][[validation:ans7]][[input:ans8]][[validation:ans8]]</span>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_EXTRA_DOUBLE_V3_PRESERVE_PRTS\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n<p>פותרים את שתי העקומות עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\frac{y^2}{{{CT:0}}^2},\\qquad x=y^2\\)</div>\n<p>לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:1}}}\\int_{y^2/{{CT:0}}^2}^{y^2}{{CT:2}}\\,dx\\,dy\\)</div>\n<p>לאחר האינטגרציה לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\)</span> מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:1}}}{{CT:3}}\\,dy={{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt5]]<span style=\"position:absolute;left:-10000px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">[[feedback:prt6]] [[feedback:prt7]] [[feedback:prt8]]</span></div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p